{"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_024CA0","resource_class":"BRIEFING_NBE","status":"TRANSLATED_PENDING_CSV_MERGE","translations":[{"unique_index":0,"cn_text":"军队是在25年前废除的。就在内战的第二年。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":59,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":1,"cn_text":"我从小就被教导内战有多么悲惨。同一个国家的人彼此争斗，是多么愚蠢、多么悲哀……","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":117,"review_flag":"JPN_TAUGHT_SINCE_CHILDHOOD_RESTORED"},{"unique_index":2,"cn_text":"正因为深切体会到了这一点，才废除了军队。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":60,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":3,"cn_text":"于是把更多精力投入到教育上。据说当时的口号是“有多少士兵，就要有多少教师”。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":114,"review_flag":"JPN_SLOGAN_LITERAL_MEANING"},{"unique_index":4,"cn_text":"啊，教育很重要。就连格瓦拉，也会在游击战的间隙教人读书写字。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":90,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":5,"cn_text":"当时的哥斯达黎加很贫穷，也没什么资源。我想，军备和教育只能优先选择其中一方。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":114,"review_flag":"AUX_SECOND_SENTENCE_RESTORED"}]}